    "chunk_size_bytes": 1001,
    "chunk_text": "Recognising that talent remains the industry\u2019s greatest competitive advantage, SLASSCOM will also strengthen collaboration between academia and industry through structured internship and industry readiness programmes, providing the students with practical exposure across software engineering, AI, data analytics, cybersecurity, product development and digital marketing.\n\nThe board for the 2026/27 term comprises Haridhu Abeygoonaratne (Managing Director \u2013 SimCentric Technologies), Vice Chair 1; Sanjini Munaweera (Regional Head South Asia Customer Engagement Solutions, ADA), Vice Chair 2; Shanaka Fernando (Managing Director/Country Head \u2013 WNS Sri Lanka), Director \u2013 Operations and Bimal Gunapala (VP Engineering \u2013 Global Frontiers), Director \u2013 Finance.\n\nTogether, the board will work closely with the members, government, academia and ecosystem partners to advance SLASSCOM\u2019s strategic priorities and create greater opportunities for Sri Lanka\u2019s knowledge and innovation industry."
